<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were</p>
<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Wednesday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Super Spirit	    raw sugar     dsg	 16,500</p>
<p> - Helmos		    cement	  ldg	 14,600</p>
<p> - Sammarina 2	     nitrate	 ldg	  8,500</p>
<p> - Cadmus		    rolled metal  ldg	  8,400</p>
<p> - Dalaki		    cement	  ldg	 28,500</p>
<p> - Handy Tiger	     iron plates   ldg	 11,750</p>
<p> - Agnita		    cement	  ldg	 12,000</p>
<p> - Blue Bird		 fertilizers   ldg	  5,000</p>
<p> - Al Bushra		 nitrate	 ldg	  5,250</p>
<p> - Flag Karin		soy meal	dsg  *    29,167</p>
<p>* cargo in transit</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
